# The Plucky Squire (PPSA15319): fresh-save route through title, slot, and play-style menus.
# Full 4K rendering advances at less than one flip per second on some hosts, so use wall-clock
# windows rather than frame numbers. Five-second Cross pulses tolerate slow menu transitions and
# retain broad neutral gaps. Surplus pulses become ordinary gameplay actions after the last menu.
